pe\">196a33</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Sup.</span> </span>), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">EN</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1141b1</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span> <span class=\"gk\">θείως</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">by divine providence</b>, <span class=\"gk\">θ. πως</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.2.1</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">θειοτέρως</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">by special providence</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.122</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μᾶλλόν τι καὶ -ότερον</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">174</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">divinely, excellently</b>, <span class=\"gk\">εὖ γε καὶ θ</span>. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tht.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">154d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">θείως εἰρῆσθαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Metaph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1074b9</span> </span>.</div></div><div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">θεῖος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">θεῖος</span> (B), <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">one's father's</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">mother's brother, uncle</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IT</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">930</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Nu.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">124</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">And.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.18</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">117</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Chrm.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">154b</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Men.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ὁ πρὸς μητρὸς θ</span>. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Is.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.10</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πρὸς πατρός</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ph.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.172</span> </span>. (Cf.<span class=\"gk\">τήθη</span>.)</div></div>"}